  lex_comments_err_unterminated.pcpp - Lexical: a block comment never closed

  Break step of lex_comments: a block comment that reaches the end of the
  file is LX0003, reported where it starts. The marker on that line sits
  inside what the lexer could not close; the suite reads it there.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe lex_comments_err_unterminated;

/*
  @@test
    kind error
  @@end
*/

begin
  /* never closed // ERROR LX0003@3: Unterminated block comment
end.
